The '''Infested House''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|West Village}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the [[Pet House]].

== Features ==
Surrounding the '''Infested House''' are {{MobSprite|Silverfish}}, Flies and Spiders. These can be vacuumed with a {{Item|Turbomax Vacuum Cleaner}} and subsequently deposited in the {{Green|{{ID|Cauldron (item)!Vermin Bin|nolink=true}}}} on the ground floor of the '''Infested House'''. Having deposited enough vermin in the bin allows the player to purchase items from {{NPCSprite|Kat (Rift);Kat}}, at a cost.

